<title>SWEDEN: Saab Automobile says to replace part in Saab 900s.</title>
<headline>Saab Automobile says to replace part in Saab 900s.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish-U.S. car maker Saab Automobile said on Monday it would offer owners free replacement of a potentially faulty component in the throttle linkage of 177,000 SAAB 900s.</p>
</text>
